icons-heroicons (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Packaging as icons-heroicons with iconlibutils launcher.
  * Install prebuilt index/ web preview and FAISS faiss.* beside icons.
  * library.iconlib: icons_root=data/svg, faiss_index for NL search.
  * Prefer data/svg for meson install; ignore index/ (track faiss.*).

